          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Using the distributive law, we multiply each term inside the parentheses by the number <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6\\mathbin{:}]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (7 + 4y) \u22c5 6|=; 7 \u22c5 6 + 4y \u22c5 6|=; 42 + 24y]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Using the distributive law, we multiply each term inside the parentheses by the number [MATH: 6\\mathbin{:}]\n\n[MATH: (7 + 4y) \u22c5 6|=; 7 \u22c5 6 + 4y \u22c5 6|=; 42 + 24y]",
